Package: habr-nagios-plugin-sitemap
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Validate website sitemap trees for Nagios-style monitoring
 Habr Nagios Plugins probe package for sitemap monitoring.
 .
 Installs the check_habr_sitemap plugin under /usr/lib/nagios/plugins/.

